#: ../../source/installation/installing_composer.rst:2
msgid "Composer Installation"
msgstr "Composer 설치"

#: ../../source/installation/installing_composer.rst:8
msgid "Composer can be used in two ways to install CodeIgniter4 on your system."
msgstr "Composer를 사용하여 시스템에 CodeIgniter4를 설치하는 방법은 두 가지가 있습니다."

#: ../../source/installation/installing_composer.rst:10
msgid "CodeIgniter4 requires Composer 2.0.14 or later."
msgstr "CodeIgniter4는 Composer 2.0.14 이상이 필요합니다."

#: ../../source/installation/installing_composer.rst:12
msgid ""
"If you are not familiar with Composer, we recommend you read `Basic usage"
" <https://getcomposer.org/doc/01-basic-usage.md>`_ first."
msgstr ""
"Composer에 익숙하지 않다면 `\ 기본 사용법 <https://getcomposer.org/doc/01-basic-"
"usage.md>`_\\ 을 먼저 읽어보는 것을 권장합니다."

#: ../../source/installation/installing_composer.rst:15
msgid ""
"The first technique describes creating a skeleton project (app starter) "
"using CodeIgniter4, that you would then use as the base for a new webapp."
" The second technique described below lets you add CodeIgniter4 to an "
"existing webapp,"
msgstr ""
"첫 번째 기술은 CodeIgniter4를 사용하여 스켈레톤 프로젝트(App Starter)를 생성하고 이를 새로운 웹 앱의 기반으로"
" 사용하는 방법을 설명합니다. 아래에 설명된 두 번째 기술은 기존 웹 앱에 CodeIgniter4를 추가하는 방법을 설명합니다."

#: ../../source/installation/installing_composer.rst:20
msgid ""
"If you are using a Git repository to store your code, or for "
"collaboration with others, then the **vendor** folder would normally be "
"\"git ignored\". In such a case, you will need to do a ``composer "
"install`` (or ``composer update`` if you want to update all Composer "
"dependencies) when you clone the repository to a new system."
msgstr ""
"코드를 저장하거나 다른 사람과 협업하기 위해 Git 저장소를 사용하는 경우, **vendor** 폴더는 일반적으로 \"git "
"ignored\" 상태여야 합니다. 이러한 경우 저장소를 새로운 시스템에 복제할 때 ``composer install``\ (또는 모든"
" Composer 의존성을 업데이트하려면 ``composer update``)을 실행해야 합니다."

#: ../../source/installation/installing_composer.rst:27
msgid "App Starter"
msgstr "App Starter"

#: ../../source/installation/installing_composer.rst:29
msgid ""
"The `CodeIgniter 4 app starter "
"<https://github.com/codeigniter4/appstarter>`_ repository holds a "
"skeleton application, with a composer dependency on the latest released "
"version of the framework."
msgstr ""
"`CodeIgniter 4 App Starter <https://github.com/codeigniter4/appstarter>`_"
" 저장소는 프레임워크의 최신 출시 버전에 대한 Composer 의존성을 가진 스켈레톤 애플리케이션을 담고 있습니다."

#: ../../source/installation/installing_composer.rst:33
msgid ""
"This installation technique would suit a developer who wishes to start a "
"new CodeIgniter4 based project."
msgstr "이 설치 기술은 새로운 CodeIgniter4 기반 프로젝트를 시작하려는 개발자에게 적합합니다."

#: ../../source/installation/installing_composer.rst:37
#: ../../source/installation/installing_composer.rst:228
msgid "Installation"
msgstr "설치"

#: ../../source/installation/installing_composer.rst:39
msgid "In the folder above your project root:"
msgstr "프로젝트 루트 상위 폴더에서:"

#: ../../source/installation/installing_composer.rst:45
msgid "The command above will create a **project-root** folder."
msgstr "위의 명령은 **project-root** 폴더를 생성합니다."

#: ../../source/installation/installing_composer.rst:47
msgid ""
"If you omit the \"project-root\" argument, the command will create an "
"\"appstarter\" folder, which can be renamed as appropriate."
msgstr ""
"\"project-root\" 인자를 생략하면 명령은 \"appstarter\" 폴더를 생성하며, 필요에 따라 이름을 변경할 수 "
"있습니다."

#: ../../source/installation/installing_composer.rst:50
msgid ""
"Before v4.4.0, CodeIgniter autoloader did not allow special characters "
"that are illegal in filenames on certain operating systems. The symbols "
"that can be used are ``/``, ``_``, ``.``, ``:``, ``\\`` and space. So if "
"you installed CodeIgniter under the folder that contains the special "
"characters like ``(``, ``)``, etc., CodeIgniter didn't work. Since "
"v4.4.0, this restriction has been removed."
msgstr ""
"v4.4.0 이전의 CodeIgniter 오토로더는 특정 운영체제의 파일 이름에서 허용되지 않는 특수 문자를 허용하지 않았습니다. "
"사용할 수 있는 기호는 ``/``, ``_``, ``.``, ``:``, ``\\`` 및 공백이었습니다. 따라서 ``\ (``, "
"``)`` 등과 같은 특수 문자가 포함된 폴더 아래에 CodeIgniter를 설치하면 작동하지 않았습니다. v4.4.0부터 이 "
"제한이 제거되었습니다."

#: ../../source/installation/installing_composer.rst:57
#: ../../source/installation/installing_composer.rst:239
msgid ""
"When you deploy to your production server, don't forget to run the "
"following command:"
msgstr "운영 서버에 배포할 때는 다음 명령을 실행하는 것을 잊지 마세요:"

#: ../../source/installation/installing_composer.rst:64
#: ../../source/installation/installing_composer.rst:246
msgid ""
"The above command will remove the Composer packages only for development "
"that are not needed in the production environment. This will greatly "
"reduce the vendor folder size."
msgstr ""
"위의 명령은 운영 환경에서 필요하지 않은 개발 전용 Composer 패키지를 제거합니다. 이는 vendor 폴더의 크기를 크게 "
"줄여줍니다."

#: ../../source/installation/installing_composer.rst:69
msgid "Installing Previous Versions"
msgstr "이전 버전 설치"

#: ../../source/installation/installing_composer.rst:71
msgid ""
"For example, you may want to install v4.4.8 after v4.5.0 has been "
"released."
msgstr "예를 들어, v4.5.0이 출시된 후 v4.4.8을 설치하고 싶을 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/installation/installing_composer.rst:73
msgid "In that case, specify the version in the command:"
msgstr "이 경우 명령에 버전을 지정합니다:"

#: ../../source/installation/installing_composer.rst:79
msgid ""
"Then, open **composer.json** in your project root folder, and specify the"
" framework version:"
msgstr "그런 다음 프로젝트 루트 폴더의 **composer.json**\\ 을 열고 프레임워크 버전을 지정합니다."

#: ../../source/installation/installing_composer.rst:89
#: ../../source/installation/installing_composer.rst:132
#: ../../source/installation/installing_composer.rst:292
msgid "Then, run the ``composer update`` command."
msgstr "그런 다음 ``composer update`` 명령을 실행합니다."

#: ../../source/installation/installing_composer.rst:91
#: ../../source/installation/installing_composer.rst:134
msgid ""
"When you use a fixed version number like ``\"codeigniter4/framework\": "
"\"4.4.8\"`` in your **composer.json**, ``composer update`` command will "
"not update the framework to the latest version. See `Writing Version "
"Constraints`_ for how to specify the version."
msgstr ""
"**composer.json**\\ 에서 ``\"codeigniter4/framework\": \"4.4.8\"``\\ 과 같이 "
"고정된 버전 번호를 사용하면 ``composer update`` 명령이 프레임워크를 최신 버전으로 업데이트하지 않습니다. 버전을 "
"지정하는 방법은 `Writing Version Constraints`_\\ 를 참조하세요."

#: ../../source/installation/installing_composer.rst:98
#: ../../source/installation/installing_composer.rst:258
msgid "Initial Configuration"
msgstr "초기 설정"

#: ../../source/installation/installing_composer.rst:100
msgid ""
"After installation, a few initial configurations are required. See :ref"
":`initial-configuration` for the details."
msgstr "설치 후 몇 가지 초기 설정이 필요합니다. 자세한 내용은 :ref:`initial-configuration`\\ 를 참조하세요."

#: ../../source/installation/installing_composer.rst:106
#: ../../source/installation/installing_composer.rst:266
msgid "Upgrading"
msgstr "업그레이드"

#: ../../source/installation/installing_composer.rst:108
#: ../../source/installation/installing_composer.rst:268
msgid ""
"Whenever there is a new release, then from the command line in your "
"project root:"
msgstr "새로운 출시가 있을 때마다 프로젝트 루트의 명령줄에서 다음을 실행합니다:"

#: ../../source/installation/installing_composer.rst:114
#: ../../source/installation/installing_composer.rst:274
msgid ""
"Read the :doc:`upgrade instructions <upgrading>` and :doc:`change log "
"<../changelogs/index>`, and check Breaking Changes and Enhancements."
msgstr ""
":doc:`\ 업그레이드 지침 <upgrading>` 및 :doc:`\ 변경 로그 <../changelogs/index>`\\ 를 읽고 "
"호환성이 중단되는 변경 사항(Breaking Changes)과 개선 사항을 확인하세요."

#: ../../source/installation/installing_composer.rst:118
#: ../../source/installation/installing_composer.rst:278
msgid "Upgrading to a Specified Version"
msgstr "특정 버전으로 업그레이드"

#: ../../source/installation/installing_composer.rst:120
#: ../../source/installation/installing_composer.rst:280
msgid ""
"For example, you may want to upgrade from v4.4.7 to v4.4.8 after v4.5.0 "
"has been released."
msgstr "예를 들어, v4.5.0이 출시된 후 v4.4.7에서 v4.4.8로 업그레이드하고 싶을 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/installation/installing_composer.rst:122
#: ../../source/installation/installing_composer.rst:282
msgid ""
"In that case, open **composer.json** in your project root folder, and "
"specify the framework version:"
msgstr "이 경우 프로젝트 루트 폴더의 **composer.json**\\ 을 열고 프레임워크 버전을 지정합니다."

#: ../../source/installation/installing_composer.rst:139
#: ../../source/installation/installing_composer.rst:295
msgid "Pros"
msgstr "장점"

#: ../../source/installation/installing_composer.rst:141
msgid "Simple installation; easy to update."
msgstr "간단한 설치, 쉬운 업데이트."

#: ../../source/installation/installing_composer.rst:144
#: ../../source/installation/installing_composer.rst:300
msgid "Cons"
msgstr "단점"

#: ../../source/installation/installing_composer.rst:146
msgid ""
"You still need to check for file changes in the **project space** (root, "
"app, public, writable) and merge them after updating."
msgstr ""
"업데이트 후 **\ 프로젝트 공간**\ (루트, app, public, writable)의 파일 변경 사항을 확인하고 병합해야 합니다."

#: ../../source/installation/installing_composer.rst:149
#: ../../source/installation/installing_composer.rst:305
#, python-format
msgid ""
"There are some third-party CodeIgniter modules available to assist with "
"merging changes to the project space: `Explore on Packagist "
"<https://packagist.org/explore/?query=codeigniter4%20updates>`_."
msgstr ""
"프로젝트 공간의 변경 사항 병합을 도와주는 서드파티 CodeIgniter 모듈이 있습니다: `Packagist에서 탐색 "
"<https://packagist.org/explore/?query=codeigniter4%20updates>`_."

#: ../../source/installation/installing_composer.rst:154
#: ../../source/installation/installing_composer.rst:310
msgid "Structure"
msgstr "구조"

#: ../../source/installation/installing_composer.rst:156
#: ../../source/installation/installing_composer.rst:312
